{"id":"kruphix","name":"Kruphix","type":"deity","aliases":["the eldest of the gods","the god of horizons","the god of mysteries"],"description":"The four-armed, starry god of mysteries and horizons, who tells Kydele that the gods are beliefs that took form in Nyx and fears threats from other worlds.","pages":4,"first_seen":"2014-02-14","last_seen":"2016-10-26","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"kioras-followers-2014-02-14-e5","summary":"The tritons explain the Silence, saying the gods retreated into Nyx after Kruphix spoke and blaming the Sun's Champion for slaying Nylea's hydra.","participants":["kalemnos","tritons","kruphix","sun-s-champion","nylea"],"location":"siren-sea","importance":"major","page":"stories/kioras-followers-2014-02-14","order":20,"story_date":"2014-02-14","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"The Sun's Champion slew Nylea's pet hydra.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14#:~:text=The%20Sun%27s%20Champion%20slew%20Nylea%27s%20pet%20hydra.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kiora's Followers","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14#:~:text=The%20Sun%27s%20Champion%20slew%20Nylea%27s%20pet%20hydra.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kiora's Followers\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e0","summary":"Diantha brings the Oracle of Kruphix her meal in Meletis and the oracle says Kruphix once spirited her away to his true temple.","participants":["diantha","kydele","kruphix","meletis"],"location":"meletis","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"When I was in danger, Kruphix spirited me away to his temple.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=When%20I%20was%20in,away%20to%20his%20temple.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=When%20I%20was%20in,away%20to%20his%20temple.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e3","summary":"Kydele feels dead inside and finds that Kruphix, who had spoken to her constantly, has fallen silent since Heliod's betrayal.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"But since Heliod's act of betrayal, the voice of her god had fallen silent.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e4","summary":"Kruphix speaks to Kydele, who asks whether what happened was good and why it feels wrong.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"does it all feel so wrong?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=does%20it%20all%20feel%20so%20wrong%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=does%20it%20all%20feel%20so%20wrong%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e5","summary":"Kruphix tells Kydele that the gods are beliefs that took form in Nyx, that Heliod was not always the sun god and that gods depend on mortals believing they are unchanging.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","heliod"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"The gods are beliefs that took form within the fabric of Nyx.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=The%20gods%20are%20beliefs,the%20fabric%20of%20Nyx.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=The%20gods%20are%20beliefs,the%20fabric%20of%20Nyx.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e6","summary":"Kruphix warns her that knowledge is cruel; Kydele insists she wants to know, and they walk to the edge of the world.","participants":["kruphix","kydele"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":92,"quote":"they came to the edge of the world itself","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=they%20came%20to%20the,of%20the%20world%20itself","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=they%20came%20to%20the,of%20the%20world%20itself","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e7","summary":"Kruphix reveals that Theros is one of many worlds and that world-walkers like Elspeth, Ajani, Kiora and Xenagos have walked between them.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","elspeth-tirel","ajani-goldmane","kiora","xenagos"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"So was the triton—the merfolk—Kiora, who called herself Callaphe and earned the ire of Thassa.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=So%20was%20the%20triton%E2%80%94the,the%20ire%20of%20Thassa.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=So%20was%20the%20triton%E2%80%94the,the%20ire%20of%20Thassa.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e8","summary":"Kruphix explains that Xenagos traveled to godless worlds and tried to show everyone the gods were a lie, but people saw only chaos and he threatened nothing.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","xenagos"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":109,"quote":"decided everyone on Theros should know the gods were a lie.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=decided%20everyone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=decided%20everyone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e9","summary":"Kruphix reveals his fear: threats from the Eldrazi, an ancient dragon planeswalker and Phyrexia could destroy Theros while even the gods are powerless.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","kiora","ajani-goldmane","elspeth-tirel","eldrazi","new-phyrexia"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"even the gods may be powerless to stop them.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=even%20the%20gods%20may,powerless%20to%20stop%20them.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=even%20the%20gods%20may,powerless%20to%20stop%20them.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26-e6","summary":"Kruphix reveals to Kydele the nature of the gods and Theros's place in the Multiverse.","participants":["kydele","kruphix","theros"],"location":"theros","importance":"major","page":"stories/its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26","order":142,"story_date":"2016-10-26","storyline":"Commander (2016 Edition)","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"Kruphix himself revealed to Kydele the true nature of the gods and Theros's place in the Multiverse, a sight she can never unsee.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26#:~:text=Kruphix%20himself%20revealed%20to,she%20can%20never%20unsee.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"It's Time to Talk Commander (2016 Edition)!","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Magic Creative Team"],"date":"2016-10-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/its-time-talk-commander-2016-edition-2016-10-26#:~:text=Kruphix%20himself%20revealed%20to,she%20can%20never%20unsee.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"It's Time to Talk Commander (2016 Edition)!\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Oct 2016."}}],"relations":[{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-r0","source":"wizards","relation":"serves","target":"kruphix","note":"Kydele is Kruphix's oracle.","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","paragraph":27,"quote":"when she awakened as his oracle","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=when%20she%20awakened%20as%20his%20oracle","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=when%20she%20awakened%20as%20his%20oracle","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-r4","source":"wizards","relation":"serves","target":"kruphix","note